  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original deep, rounded quadrangular closed fossil shell informed by photographed Cucullaea (Idonearca) vulgaris. Historical Cucullaea (Idonearca) vulgaris, now captioned Idonearca vulgaris. Nominal 49 mm side length, height and depth are an artistic multi-specimen interpretation.",
